<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Tears For Fun</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Griff</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Vertigo</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2cmxKeY72HeimX9tcm57Ru</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.898" end="00:04.549">When it kills your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.549" end="00:06.565">But you can't say no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.565" end="00:08.181">When it burns you red</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.181" end="00:10.416">But you won't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.416" end="00:12.232">The deepest cuts well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.232" end="00:14.083">They heal so slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.083" end="00:15.864">I hope they do, God</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.864" end="00:19.824">But what if they don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.824" end="00:23.440">Take my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.440" end="00:26.856">Shoot me in the dark</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.856" end="00:30.491">You've really done some damage</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.491" end="00:34.557">You've really messed me up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.557" end="00:37.760">Tell me, why?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.760" end="00:41.373">There's a wire in my brain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.373" end="00:45.072">That doesn't know the difference</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.072" end="00:48.182">Loving and in pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.182" end="00:50.977">Oh, isn't it the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.977" end="00:54.608">'Cause when the clocks keep rolling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.608" end="00:58.293">When the days and years have gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.293" end="01:04.694">Will I still be here collecting tears for fun?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.694" end="01:06.368">When it kills your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.368" end="01:08.445">But you can't say no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.445" end="01:09.978">When it burns you red</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.978" end="01:12.280">But you won't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.280" end="01:14.083">The deepest cuts well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.083" end="01:15.896">They heal so slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.896" end="01:17.680">I hope they do, God</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.680" end="01:21.782">But what if they don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.782" end="01:25.062">Take my years</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.062" end="01:28.575">So how can that be fair?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.575" end="01:32.257">And if you call me any moment</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.257" end="01:35.959">Said, "I would be right there"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.959" end="01:39.641">I would take the left</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.641" end="01:41.935">Just beyond the bridge</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.935" end="01:45.543">And I would take it right up 'til the fourth floor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.543" end="01:47.043">Where it finds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.914" end="01:50.546">Broken promises</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.546" end="01:52.738">That I'm still trying to fix</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.738" end="01:59.292">Will I always be collecting my tears for fun?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.292" end="02:00.908">When it kills your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.908" end="02:02.994">But you can't say no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.994" end="02:04.543">When it burns you red</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.543" end="02:06.807">But you won't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.807" end="02:08.572">The deepest cuts well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.572" end="02:10.474">They heal so slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.474" end="02:12.242">I hope they do god</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.242" end="02:13.850">But what if they don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.850" end="02:15.399">When it kills your heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.399" end="02:17.518">But you can't say no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.518" end="02:19.102">When it burns you red</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.102" end="02:21.339">But you won't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.339" end="02:23.139">The deepest cuts well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.139" end="02:24.990">They heal so slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.990" end="02:26.755">I hope they do, God</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.755" end="02:34.755">But what if they don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.632" end="02:37.232">Yeah, I really hope they do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.232" end="02:41.357">Yeah, I really want them to, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.357" end="02:45.157">Yeah, what if they don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.157" end="02:48.856">What if they don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.856" end="02:52.170">Oh yeah, oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.170" end="02:57.456">Yeah, what if they don't?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.456" end="02:59.088">When it kills your heart but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.088" end="03:01.141">You can't say no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.141" end="03:02.658">When it burns you red</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.658" end="03:04.992">But you won't let go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.992" end="03:06.760">The deepest cuts well</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.760" end="03:08.642">They heal so slow</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.642" end="03:10.410">I hope they do, God</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.410" end="03:14.410">But what if they don't?</p></div></body></tt>